Amount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "2017", "starCount": 0, "title": "简述氮循环包括的主要生物化学过程。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2120654, "umcId": 15970027, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 53}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)特点：<br>①r对策者：增殖率高，发育快，个体小，世代周期短，竞争力弱，适应不稳定环境。<br>②K对策者：增殖率低，发育慢，个体较大，世代周期长，竞争力强，适应稳定环境。<br>(2)策略：<br>①K对策者的种群增长曲线既有平衡点，也有灭绝点；种群数量低于灭绝点，种群会走向灭亡。<br>②K对策濒危物种一旦受到危害导致其数量下降到灭绝点以下，种群数量将极难恢复。因此，在濒危物种保护中，应维持种群数量在灭绝点以上。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2120655, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "论述题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本生态学基础真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 20, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 20, "source": "2017", "starCount": 0, "title": "r对策者和K对策者各有哪些特点？请依据K对策者种群增长曲线的特点，论述K对策濒危物种的保护策略。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2120655, "umcId": 15970027, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 54}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 54, "CourseId": "H012701", "ExamTime": 150, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "历年真题", "ExamName": "2017年成考专升本生态学基础真题"}, "simId": 17049}